<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #16263F 0%, #1E3A5F 100%)',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: -60, right: -60, width: 260, height: 260, borderRadius: 130, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.1)' }} />

  <Box style={{ position: 'relative', zIndex: 2, width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 14 }}>CHAPTER 04 · 工具与演进</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 26 }}>AI 编程演进：补全 → 对话 → Agent → 规范驱动</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginBottom: 26 }}>
      {[
        { t: '补全', d: '写完一句接下一句' },
        { t: '对话', d: '问答式写代码' },
        { t: 'Agent', d: '自主拆解执行' },
        { t: '规范驱动', d: '先对齐规格再动手' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', flex: 1 }}>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: idx === 3 ? 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)' : 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.2)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 16px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: idx === 3 ? '#FF9F1C' : '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 6 }}>{item.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#DCE7F5', textAlign: 'center' }}>{item.d}</Text>
          </Box>
          {idx < 3 && (
            <Box style={{ width: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
              <FAIcon name='arrow-right' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 16, height: 16 }} />
            </Box>
          )}
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.12)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,159,28,0.3)', borderRadius: 14, padding: '20px 26px', marginBottom: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF9F1C', marginBottom: 8 }}>动手练习</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
        挑一个小需求，走一遍 Spec-Kit 的 specify → clarify → plan → implement，并让 code-review 子 Agent 给一份坏味道清单。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
        自测 3 题：Spec 六要素是什么？评审循环是哪四步？MCP 和 Skill 的分工是什么？
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
